On 10/22/2013 02:58 AM, Herv? Pag?s wrote:
> Hi Kim,
>
> On 10/18/2013 11:04 PM, Kim Siegmund wrote:
>> Dear Herve,
>>
>> I work with Tim Triche Jr. at USC and he told me you were the best person to
